  <refpurpose></refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoNodeDestroy(SilikoNode *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The `SilikoSyntaxTreeDelete` function deletes a syntax tree node,
and if the `SilikoSyntaxTreeNode` object is a branch node, deletes its
child nodes and any other descendant nodes.

* `SyntaxTree` is the `SilikoSyntaxTreeNode` object to delete. </para>
</refsection>
